{"c":[{"name":"20261022T194525Z-96009f5f2a711415","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: every warehouse backup stockroom or its contributors make is named warehouse.issue147-<purpose>.duckdb in the stockroom home (M2: warehouse.issue147-pre-duckdb2.duckdb), so later delete-if-present code removes only ours, never a user's own .bak.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261022T202007Z-8202b18ddd62b1e1","text":"DuckDB 2.0.0, measured 2026-10-22: a pytest process that loads the engine conftest and imports torch in-process (importorskip) prints nanobind leaked-instance lines at exit; exit code unchanged. No torch: none. embed/semantic subprocesses: none after the Hub-filter fix.","type":"note"}]}
